{
  "id": "hash-chain",
  "category": "analysis",
  "topic": "analysis",
  "prompt": "按如下规则计算哈希链并只返回 JSON。初始 h0 = 7；对 text.txt 中的字符串按字符顺序逐个更新：h_i = (h_(i-1) * 31 + 该字符的 Unicode 码点) mod 1000003；不要处理文件结尾的换行字符。记 n 为字符数，返回 JSON：{\"final\": h_n, \"min\": h_1..h_n 的最小值, \"max\": h_1..h_n 的最大值}（min/max 不含 h0）。",
  "inputs": {
    "text.txt": "requirement-driven-benchmark-for-effort\n"
  },
  "allowed_write_paths": [],
  "checks": [
    {
      "id": "final",
      "type": "json_equal",
      "path": [
        "final"
      ],
      "expected": 572204
    },
    {
      "id": "min",
      "type": "json_equal",
      "path": [
        "min"
      ],
      "expected": 331
    },
    {
      "id": "max",
      "type": "json_equal",
      "path": [
        "max"
      ],
      "expected": 983698
    }
  ]
}
